error[Z0401]: the graph has an undirected edge, `--`, so `instruments` cannot say what an instrument is related to
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:1
  |
1 | dag {
  | ^^^^^ a graph with an undirected edge
  |
  = help: an undirected edge is for drawing and says nothing of cause: write `a -> b` for a cause, or `a <-> b` for a common cause that is not observed

