  = help: usage: `g.instruments(exposure: Var, outcome: Var)`

error[Z0406]: `instruments` needs `exposure:`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:3
  |
2 | g.instruments()
  |   ^^^^^^^^^^^ `exposure:` is missing
